sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Rider App
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant RS as Ride Service
    participant PS as Pricing Service
    participant MS as Matching Service
    participant GI as Geo Index
    participant LS as Location Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant D as Driver App
    participant DB as Database
    participant Cache as Redis

    Note over R, DB: Ride Request Flow

    R->>AG: POST /rides/request
    AG->>RS: Create ride request
    RS->>PS: Calculate fare estimate
    PS->>Cache: Get surge multiplier for zone
    Cache-->>PS: Surge data
    PS->>PS: Apply surge pricing
    PS-->>RS: Estimated fare with surge
    RS->>DB: Save ride request (status: requested)
    RS-->>R: Ride created, searching for driver

    Note over RS, GI: Driver Matching

    RS->>MS: Find matching driver
    MS->>GI: Query nearby drivers
    GI->>Cache: Get drivers in geohash cells
    Cache-->>GI: Available driver locations
    GI-->>MS: Candidate drivers (sorted by distance)
    
    loop For each candidate driver
        MS->>NS: Send ride offer to driver
        NS->>D: Push notification
        D-->>NS: Accept/Reject
        alt Driver accepts
            NS-->>MS: Accepted
            MS->>DB: Update ride (driver_id, status: matched)
            MS-->>RS: Match found
        else Driver rejects/timeout
            NS-->>MS: Rejected/Timeout
            MS->>MS: Try next driver
        end
    end

    RS->>NS: Notify rider of match
    NS->>R: Driver assigned notification
    RS-->>R: Driver details + ETA

    Note over D, R: Driver Arrives

    loop Until pickup
        D->>LS: Update location
        LS->>Cache: Store driver location
        LS->>RS: Location update
        RS->>R: Driver location update
    end

    D->>RS: Arrived at pickup
    RS->>DB: Update ride (status: driver_arriving)
    RS->>NS: Notify rider
    NS->>R: Driver has arrived

    Note over D, DB: Trip in Progress

    D->>RS: Start trip
    RS->>DB: Update ride (status: in_progress, pickup_at)
    RS->>R: Trip started

    loop During trip
        D->>LS: Update location
        LS->>DB: Store tracking point
        LS->>R: Real-time location
    end

    D->>RS: End trip
    RS->>PS: Calculate final fare
    PS->>PS: Distance + time + surge
    PS-->>RS: Final fare
    RS->>DB: Update ride (status: completed, actual_fare)
    RS->>R: Trip completed, show fare
    RS->>D: Trip completed, show earnings
